{title: 2. Tu Nos Darás La Vida}
{subtitle: Canto de Perdón}
{key: Am}

{comment: Coro}
{start_of_chorus}
[Dm]Tú serás nuestra [Am]Luz,  
Tú nos salva[E]rás,  
Tú nos darás la [Am]vida[A7] 
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Verso 1}
{start_of_verse}
[Am]Si de [E]Ti me ale[Am]jé,  
sin [Dm]luz y sin [Am]fe,  
Se[E]ñor, ten pie[A7]dad.
{end_of_verse}

{comment: Verso 2}
{start_of_verse}
[Am]Si al her[E]mano ne[Am]gué  
la [Dm]paz que nos [Am]das,  
Se[E]ñor, ten pie[Am]dad.[A7]
{end_of_verse}
